# Resident Legacy Protection

The workspace may contain a folder named:

REFERENCE ONLY - Resident Legacy

This folder is strictly read-only reference material.

## Never perform these actions inside the legacy folder

- Never create files
- Never edit files
- Never delete files
- Never rename or move files
- Never format files
- Never install packages
- Never run database migrations
- Never change environment files
- Never commit or push
- Never run commands whose working directory is the legacy folder

## Allowed actions

- Read source code
- Search source code
- Analyze business logic
- Analyze UI flows
- Analyze validation
- Analyze Prisma models
- Analyze API behavior
- Analyze permissions and reports

## Implementation rule

All new source code, documentation, tests, migrations, and configuration
must be created inside the TARGET project only.

Before making changes, list the files that will be modified and confirm
that every file is inside the TARGET project.
